  "question": {
    "text": "An inductor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mH</mi></math>, a capacitor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math> and a resistor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> are connected in series with a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> ac source. If the current is in phase with the emf, the frequency of ac source will be ______<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given here:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p>If current is in phase with emf, so this is the condition of resonance.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn><msqrt><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>28</mn><msqrt><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>503</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p>",
